# `.demo-state.json` records which `currency` rows were switched OFF before the
# seeder switched them on — the one thing `--drop` cannot learn from the rows
# themselves. It is machine-local state and must never travel with the script.
#
# The seeder itself DOES ship now. The root .gitignore used to exclude this
# whole directory while two of its library files were already tracked, so a
# fresh clone got orphans and nothing runnable; that rule is narrowed to the
# state file, and this is the belt to its braces.
.demo-state.json
